    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Real Estate WhatsApp AI Assistant\n\n**Who it's for**\nReal estate agencies handling property enquiries over WhatsApp.\n\n**What it does**\nAnswers property questions from a live Airtable database, qualifies leads as hot, warm, or cold, checks calendar availability before booking viewings, and escalates to a human agent when needed.\n\n**How it works**\n1. Customer sends a text or voice message on WhatsApp\n2. Voice notes are transcribed before reaching the agent\n3. The AI agent looks up real property data and calendar availability\n4. A structured reply is sent back and the lead is logged\n5. Hot leads or failures trigger a notification to the team\n\n**How to use**\nAdd your WhatsApp, Gemini, Airtable, Calendar, and Sheets credentials, then activate the workflow.",
        "height": 476,
        "width": 1496
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1264,
        1792
